# 4p Query (pattern_1100): concept_musicalbum_solaris --[concept:agentcreated_reverse]--> ? --[concept:agentcompeteswithagent_reverse]--> ? --[concept:subpartof_reverse]--> ? --[concept:personborninlocation_reverse]--> ?
